title Discovery Flow

participant "User" as User
participant "CLI" as CLI
participant "IntentParser" as Parser
participant "IntentResolutionEngine" as ResolutionEngine
participant "PresetManager" as PresetManager
participant "DiscoveryPipeline" as Pipeline
participant "ContractRegistry" as ContractRegistry
participant "ContractRegistryBuilder" as RegistryBuilder
participant "Semantic Cache" as Cache

User->CLI: Execute discovery command\n--intent=<goal> or --preset=<name>
activate CLI

alt Preset provided
    CLI->PresetManager: getPreset(presetName)
    PresetManager->PresetManager: Load from config store
    PresetManager-->CLI: ModifiableParameterSet
    CLI->ResolutionEngine: resolveToParameterSet(intent, projectRoot, preset)
else Intent-based
    CLI->Parser: parse(arguments)
    Parser-->CLI: DiscoveryIntent
    CLI->ResolutionEngine: resolve(intent)
    ResolutionEngine->ResolutionEngine: Select base strategy
    ResolutionEngine->ResolutionEngine: Apply depth adjustments
    ResolutionEngine->ResolutionEngine: Apply focus adjustments
    ResolutionEngine->ResolutionEngine: Apply constraint overrides
    ResolutionEngine->ResolutionEngine: Convert to ModifiableParameterSet
    ResolutionEngine-->CLI: DiscoveryStrategy or ModifiableParameterSet
end

CLI->CLI: Apply parameter overrides (CLI flags)
CLI->Pipeline: Instantiate with parameters
activate Pipeline

note right of Pipeline: === Phase 1: Architecture Detection ===

Pipeline->Pipeline: Detect build system
Pipeline->Pipeline: Detect clusters (build modules → directory fallback)
Pipeline->Pipeline: Call ArchitectureDetector.detectStack()
Pipeline->Pipeline: Detect frameworks and platforms per module
Pipeline->Pipeline: Detect architecture patterns
Pipeline->Pipeline: Generate TechnologyStack
Pipeline->Pipeline: Generate architecture-detection.yaml

note right of Pipeline: === Phase 2: Parallel Cluster Discovery ===

note right of Pipeline: Enable in-memory link buffering\nfor concurrent cluster processing
Pipeline->Pipeline: Enable link buffer

loop For each cluster
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Select cluster
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Load shared discovery context
    
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Extract source files
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Build components
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Discover flows
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Discover logic (business rules, entities)
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Discover structure
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Discover vision
    
    Pipeline->Cache: Write artifacts (cluster-locked)
    Cache-->Pipeline: Success
    
    Pipeline->Pipeline: Collect cluster links\n(in memory buffer)
end

note right of Pipeline: === Phase 3: Link Flushing ===

Pipeline->Pipeline: Flush all buffered links
Pipeline->Pipeline: Write links.yaml in single operation

note right of Pipeline: === Phase 4: Contract Registry ===

Pipeline->RegistryBuilder: buildAndSaveRegistry()
activate RegistryBuilder
RegistryBuilder->RegistryBuilder: Scan config store for definitions
RegistryBuilder->Cache: Scan semantic cache for artifacts
Cache-->RegistryBuilder: List of artifacts
RegistryBuilder->RegistryBuilder: Match definitions to artifacts
RegistryBuilder->RegistryBuilder: Calculate status (SATISFIED/VIOLATED/MISSING)
RegistryBuilder->RegistryBuilder: Calculate confidence scores
RegistryBuilder->ContractRegistry: Save to semantic cache
RegistryBuilder-->Pipeline: ContractRegistry
deactivate RegistryBuilder

Pipeline->ContractRegistry: Query contract health
ContractRegistry-->Pipeline: Health score, violations, gaps

Pipeline->ContractRegistry: Get violated contracts
ContractRegistry-->Pipeline: List of violated contracts

Pipeline->ContractRegistry: Get missing contracts
ContractRegistry-->Pipeline: List of missing contracts

Pipeline-->CLI: PipelineResult
deactivate Pipeline

CLI-->User: Discovery complete with results
deactivate CLI
